  "details": "## Description\n\nso, when i look at any of my friends, (only if they arent in the current instance) it shows them as a \"User\" instead of \"Trusted\" not rly anything too bad but thought it would be helpful to you guys if i pointed it out. unless this isnt a bug, then sorry!\n\n## Reproduction Steps\n\ngo to anyones profile who isnt in your current instance, and their trust level will show as \"User\"\n\n## Details\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1879-ecdbfcd219-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR",
